{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Arise</b> — Because of this you shall not rest in your land, because the land is defiled by your deeds, for it will destroy you, as in: וחבל את מעשה ידך (and it shall destroy the work of your hands)." "<b>וחבל</b> — Like pains and cords." "<b>Sore</b> — Your land shall be finished for you."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:44.042598006Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}